  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n \xE7ok alt bir noktas\u0131nda, \xE7at\u0131s\u0131 y\u0131k\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
    bir ev g\xF6r\xFCyorum. S\u0131k\u0131 bir f\u0131rt\u0131na ve b\xFCy\xFCk bir
    arbedenin sonras\u0131nda \"kalanlar\u0131\" simgeleyen bu ev, i\xE7inde pek
    \xE7ok da an\u0131 bar\u0131nd\u0131r\u0131yor olmal\u0131. Bu g\xF6rsel bana
    bir s\xF6z\xFC hat\u0131rlatt\u0131 {{isim}}; sava\u015F\u0131n\u0131 vermedi\u011Fin
    a\u015Fk\u0131n, bar\u0131\u015F\u0131ndan hay\u0131r gelmez. Bar\u0131\u015F
    istiyorsan, sava\u015Fa haz\u0131rlanmal\u0131 ve o sava\u015F\u0131 sa\u011F
    atlatmal\u0131s\u0131n. \"Si vis pacem, para bellum\" s\xF6z\xFC de bunu ifade
    ediyor. Sen sava\u015F\u0131n\u0131 vermi\u015Fsin. \u015Eu an her ne kadar ayr\u0131
    olsan\u0131z da, r\xFCzgar yak\u0131nda senden yana esecek. Sa\u011F kalan\u0131n
    \"sevginiz\" olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilmeni isterim."
